input.description:
Create the context-based compound component architecture following the SurveyBuilder pattern:

1. `apps/web/src/components/survey-runner/index.tsx` - SurveyRunner provider + context
2. `apps/web/src/components/survey-runner/runner-canvas.tsx` - Question display area
3. `apps/web/src/components/survey-runner/runner-header.tsx` - Survey title + progress
4. `apps/web/src/components/survey-runner/runner-navigation.tsx` - Back/Next/Submit buttons
5. `apps/web/src/components/survey-runner/runner-progress.tsx` - Progress bar
6. `apps/web/src/components/survey-runner/runner-complete.tsx` - Thank you screen
7. `apps/web/src/components/survey-runner/hooks/use-survey-runner.ts` - Context consumer hook

Context interface to implement:
```typescript
interface SurveyRunnerContextValue {
  survey: Survey;
  questions: Question[];
  settings: SurveySettings;
  answers: Map<string, AnswerValue>;
  currentQuestionIndex: number;
  visibleQuestionIds: Set<string>;
  canGoBack: boolean;
  canGoNext: boolean;
  isComplete: boolean;
  isSubmitting: boolean;
  setAnswer: (questionId: string, value: AnswerValue) => void;
  goNext: () => void;
  goBack: () => void;
  submit: () => Promise<void>;
  fingerprint: string | null;
}
```

Create QuestionRenderer and all question type components:

1. `apps/web/src/components/survey-runner/question-renderer/index.tsx` - QuestionRenderer that dispatches by type
2. `apps/web/src/components/survey-runner/question-renderer/text-question.tsx` - Input
3. `apps/web/src/components/survey-runner/question-renderer/textarea-question.tsx` - Textarea
4. `apps/web/src/components/survey-runner/question-renderer/choice-question.tsx` - RadioGroup for multiple_choice
5. `apps/web/src/components/survey-runner/question-renderer/checkbox-question.tsx` - Checkbox group
6. `apps/web/src/components/survey-runner/question-renderer/dropdown-question.tsx` - Select
7. `apps/web/src/components/survey-runner/question-renderer/rating-question.tsx` - Star rating
8. `apps/web/src/components/survey-runner/question-renderer/nps-question.tsx` - 0-10 NPS scale
9. `apps/web/src/components/survey-runner/question-renderer/linear-scale-question.tsx` - Slider
10. `apps/web/src/components/survey-runner/question-renderer/date-question.tsx` - Input type=date
11. `apps/web/src/components/survey-runner/question-renderer/email-question.tsx` - Input type=email
12. `apps/web/src/components/survey-runner/question-renderer/phone-question.tsx` - Input type=tel
13. `apps/web/src/components/survey-runner/question-renderer/file-upload-question.tsx` - Custom dropzone

Each component follows this interface:
```typescript
interface QuestionProps {
  question: Question;
  value: AnswerValue | undefined;
  onChange: (value: AnswerValue) => void;
  onError: (error: string | null) => void;
  disabled?: boolean;
  autoFocus?: boolean;
}
```

Use shadcn/ui primitives where applicable.

